From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:18:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] amvideocap: remove the driver

Every video frame toggle in the vsync interrupt polls amvideocap, and a
capture request configures ge2d and queues its blit from there. Kodi's
screenshot and the hyperion.ng Amlogic grabber are the last users of
/dev/amvideocap0. Their replacements and the CoreELEC config change
merge together with this one.
---
